  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9f2e8e5b57bd4bd99f33dd56077c2d1, type: 3}
  m_Name: KB_029_TrainingMode
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: POSTechSupport::POSTechSupport.Data.KnowledgeArticleSO
  articleId: KB-029
  title: Everything approves but no money arrives
  category: 0
  content: "Approvals that all succeed while nothing reaches the bank is the signature
    of training mode. The terminal simulates the whole exchange, prints a receipt,
    and sends nothing \u2014 it is designed to be convincing, which is exactly why
    it costs a shop a night's takings.\nCheck the terminal's mode first whenever
    the complaint is about money rather than about errors. A failed settlement (KB-032)
    looks similar in the bank account and completely different on screen."
  relatedErrorCodes: []
  guidanceForIssueIds:
  - P29
